WEBVTT

00:13:29.375 --> 00:13:33.500
What I want from myself
is to be put out of a job.

00:13:34.792 --> 00:13:38.434
You see, families come to me
who are grieving

00:13:38.458 --> 00:13:40.976
and I see the hope in their eyes.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.559
And I have to tell them

00:13:42.583 --> 00:13:46.976
that the chances
of anybody ever being prosecuted

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.809
for being involved
in the killing of their loved ones

00:13:49.833 --> 00:13:51.917
are very remote.

00:13:53.875 --> 00:13:56.393
I saw these grieving faces

00:13:56.417 --> 00:13:59.393
in the springtime of my career.

00:13:59.417 --> 00:14:00.768
And I still see them